        "source_tag": "tformat"
      },
      "source": "Turns the golem's skin into molten rock. The heat generated sets ablaze everything inside a radius of 3, doing %0.2f fire damage in 3 turns for %d turns.\n\t\tBurning is cumulative; the longer they stay within range, they higher the fire damage they take.\n\t\tIn addition the golem gains %d%% fire resistance.\n\t\tMolten Skin damage will not affect friendly creatures.\n\t\tThe damage and resistance will increase with your Spellpower.",
      "target": "使傀儡的皮肤化为熔岩。产生的高温会点燃半径 3 格内的一切，使其在 3 回合内受到 %0.2f 点火焰伤害；炽热皮肤持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t灼烧可以叠加；目标处于范围内越久，受到的火焰伤害越高。\n\t\t此外，傀儡获得 %d%% 火焰抗性。\n\t\t炽热皮肤造成的伤害不会影响友方生物。\n\t\t伤害和抗性随你的法术强度提高。",
      "source_tag": "tformat",
      "args_order": null,
      "special": null,
      "placeholder_sequence": [
        "%0.2f",
        "%d",
        "%d%%"
      ],
