        "line": 28955,
        "source": "%s resists the knockback!",
        "target": "%s抵抗了击退！",
        "source_tag": "logSeen",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "0ca9521f9de025bc5793170ed8d36219c663a5ba57cd3d6298e5b8c6da479bfe",
        "line": 28956,
        "source": "Your golem rushes to the target, dealing %d%% damage and knocking it back.\n\t\tKnockback chance will increase with talent level.\n\t\tWhile rushing the golem becomes ethereal, passing harmlessly through creatures on the path to its target.",
        "target": "你的傀儡冲向目标，造成 %d%% 伤害并将其击退。\n\t\t击退成功率随技能等级提高。\n\t\t冲刺期间，傀儡会化为虚体，安全穿过通往目标路径上的生物。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
