        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "9876bc3fb1b9568587744975db5389cc2f1769f2a26564e6f047272f0da58126",
        "line": 28966,
        "source": "Your golem rushes to the target, crushing it into the ground for %d turns and doing %d%% damage.\n\t\tPinning chance will increase with talent level.\n\t\tWhile rushing the golem becomes ethereal, passing harmlessly through creatures on the path to its target.",
        "target": "你的傀儡冲向目标，将其压倒在地并定身 %d 回合，造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t定身成功率随技能等级提高。\n\t\t冲刺期间，傀儡会化为虚体，安全穿过通往目标路径上的生物。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
