        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "cb8d0fea14ea516a3b1518e6b1a1a1d51b46a61888f005255cf9af9d39c23fed",
        "line": 28972,
        "source": "%s resists the dazing blow!",
        "target": "%s抵抗了眩晕打击！",
        "source_tag": "logSeen",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "1f7590b905bb96a57bbfc48b5eae05b38bd111e80886cec431de5b316b3f9ff5",
        "line": 28973,
        "source": "Your golem rushes to the target and creates a shockwave with radius 2, dazing all foes for %d turns and doing %d%% damage.\n\t\tDaze chance increases with talent level.\n\t\tWhile rushing the golem becomes ethereal, passing harmlessly through creatures on the path to its target.",
        "target": "你的傀儡冲向目标并产生半径 2 格的冲击波，使所有敌人眩晕 %d 回合并造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t眩晕成功率随技能等级提高。\n\t\t冲刺期间，傀儡会化为虚体，安全穿过通往目标路径上的生物。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "21ffd48b99725953363df1f7d95f72e9c96d2d45d4f9b7cfb03d8175f614d4da",
        "line": 28978,
        "source": "Eye Beam",
        "target": "眼睛光束",
        "source_tag": "talent name",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "a0e0844a662356818e6c5a92d32918178f02b5bf048827ac76e29ab46034a7a6",
        "line": 28979,
        "source": "Your golem fires a beam from his eyes, doing %0.2f fire damage, %0.2f cold damage or %0.2f lightning damage.\n\t\tThe beam will always be the maximun range it can be and will not harm friendly creatures.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your golem's Spellpower.",
        "target": "你的傀儡从眼中射出一道光束，造成 %0.2f 点火焰、%0.2f 点寒冷或 %0.2f 点闪电伤害。\n\t\t光束始终延伸至其最大射程，且不会伤害友方生物。\n\t\t伤害随傀儡的法术强度提高。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "d230ee4003d5b56f0e8c3025f5c06f2a89046945ab35c0f6700e2afe8c335472",
        "line": 28984,
        "source": "Reflective Skin",
        "target": "反射皮肤",
        "source_tag": "talent name",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "0efd36664fb741f438a3858adcc0bf7040ce6115feecf102f9898629e036e385",
        "line": 28985,
        "source": "Your golem's skin shimmers with eldritch energies.\n\t\tAny damage it takes is partly reflected (%d%%) to the attacker.\n\t\tThe golem still takes full damage.\n\t\tDamage returned will increase with your golem's Spellpower.",
        "target": "你的傀儡皮肤闪烁着艾尔德里奇能量。\n\t\t所有对其造成的伤害有 %d%% 被反射给攻击者。\n\t\t傀儡仍然受到全部伤害。\n\t\t伤害反射值受傀儡的法术强度加成。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "879283acc2fe6577c98cd98146a3d113741f7171f36536d8463da1dca99ad1a9",
        "line": 28992,
        "source": "Arcane Pull",
        "target": "奥术牵引",
        "source_tag": "talent name",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
