        "line": 28993,
        "source": "#Target# is pulled toward #Source#!",
        "target": "#Target#被拉向#Source#!",
        "source_tag": "logCombat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "40c359d1111bf7eacb4078cbd6632d05f59139916838c71fd5f82743347605e0",
        "line": 28994,
        "source": "Your golem pulls all foes within radius %d toward itself while dealing %0.2f arcane damage.",
        "target": "你的傀儡将 %d 码范围内的敌人牵引至身边，并造成 %0.2f 奥术伤害。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "a62ae1de6b58963b22ba7dcf5017b977d58bf0698f808e960efa5e9f63b45a07",
        "line": 28995,
        "source": "Molten Skin",
        "target": "炽热皮肤",
        "source_tag": "talent name",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null
      },
      {
        "entry_id": "c89def38fba0d91aa19843e7d730b85d71efdbf326c3de5c7e05dc46d7e4b67d",
        "line": 28996,
        "source": "Turns the golem's skin into molten rock. The heat generated sets ablaze everything inside a radius of 3, doing %0.2f fire damage in 3 turns for %d turns.\n\t\tBurning is cumulative; the longer they stay within range, they higher the fire damage they take.\n\t\tIn addition the golem gains %d%% fire resistance.\n\t\tMolten Skin damage will not affect friendly creatures.\n\t\tThe damage and resistance will increase with your Spellpower.",
        "target": "使傀儡的皮肤化为熔岩。产生的高温会点燃半径 3 格内的一切，使其在 3 回合内受到 %0.2f 点火焰伤害；炽热皮肤持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t灼烧可以叠加；目标处于范围内越久，受到的火焰伤害越高。\n\t\t此外，傀儡获得 %d%% 火焰抗性。\n\t\t炽热皮肤造成的伤害不会影响友方生物。\n\t\t伤害和抗性随你的法术强度提高。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
        "args_order": null,
        "special": null,
