        "line": 29006,
        "source": "The golem self-destructs, destroying itself and generating a blast of fire in a radius of %d, doing %0.2f fire damage.\n\t\tThis spell is only usable when the golem's master is dead.",
        "target": "傀儡引爆自己，摧毁傀儡并产生一个火焰爆炸， %d 码有效范围内造成 %0.2f 火焰伤害。\n\t\t这个技能只有傀儡的主人死亡时能够使用。",
