      },
      {
        "entry_id": "9c3bf839a035a6f3e4a0bf3d0348835fd7e7f85b2f5fa18e68d5cbad5df6e071",
        "line": 29012,
        "source": "The golem automatically reconfigures heavy mail and massive armours designed for living creatures to protect its own vital areas.\n\t%s armour value by %d, armour hardiness by %d%%, and provides %d%% critical hit reduction when wearing heavy mail or massive armour.",
        "target": "傀儡学会重新组装重甲和板甲，以便更加适用于傀儡。\n\t当装备重甲或板甲时， %s护甲 %d 点 , 护甲强度 %d%%，并且减少 %d%% 被暴击率。",
        "source_tag": "tformat",
